            {
                "entry_id": "30eb2d5e-f2a0-31b3-89cd-7a9e0c0fae4a",
                "word": "gotha",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "2dfd732f-82b7-4698-9657-5e02f1e8ecb9",
                        "entry_id": "30eb2d5e-f2a0-31b3-89cd-7a9e0c0fae4a",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "gothas"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "9f83353d-0038-37bf-8dbe-265f26a83c7b",
                        "entry_id": "30eb2d5e-f2a0-31b3-89cd-7a9e0c0fae4a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Ellipse de almanach de Gotha, bottin qui fut, entre 1763 et 1944, le guide de référence de la haute noblesse et des familles royales européennes."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "044d94de-7285-4302-847f-2deaef98d197",
                                "sense_id": "9f83353d-0038-37bf-8dbe-265f26a83c7b",
                                "text": "Être dans le gotha."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4581472b-a3fe-4514-a51f-e815db155861",
                                "sense_id": "9f83353d-0038-37bf-8dbe-265f26a83c7b",
                                "text": "Tu te trompes, j’ai cherché dans le Gotha de cette année, me confessa naïvement Bloch, et j’ai trouvé le prince de Guermantes, habitant l’hôtel où nous sommes et marié à tout ce qu’il y a de plus grandiose, attends un peu que je me rappelle, marié à Sidonie, duchesse de Duras, née des Baux."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d8a7567e-2e6e-4f4d-a47d-cf678f0b50cc",
                                "sense_id": "9f83353d-0038-37bf-8dbe-265f26a83c7b",
                                "text": "– Bien sûr, acquiesça Pia. Quand on a du sang bleu, on apprend ces détails primordiaux par cœur, en même temps que le gotha."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "cba5a4b8-f046-3709-9aee-7d93ca105626",
                        "entry_id": "30eb2d5e-f2a0-31b3-89cd-7a9e0c0fae4a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Haute noblesse européenne."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "metonymically"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c5222ead-8949-49bb-b397-f2d4a74de513",
                                "sense_id": "cba5a4b8-f046-3709-9aee-7d93ca105626",
                                "text": "Ils ne font pas partie du gotha."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "e204f911-6b82-3582-b25a-bac5b14412d9",
                        "entry_id": "30eb2d5e-f2a0-31b3-89cd-7a9e0c0fae4a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Élite fortunée."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b65c14d5-fedc-4033-beb7-0eb8164cf296",
                                "sense_id": "e204f911-6b82-3582-b25a-bac5b14412d9",
                                "text": "Ils appartiennent au gotha du capital, se partagent chaque année des millions d’euros, se votent des stock-options, des retraites chapeau. Ils exigent aujourd’hui des Français qu’ils acceptent une dégradation de leur protection sociale."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "961b466c-0b90-4736-83a4-f405213488e2",
                                "sense_id": "e204f911-6b82-3582-b25a-bac5b14412d9",
                                "text": "Je les connais, ces affranchies du Gotha, dont l’âme est sertie de gemmes rares par M. Cartier et le corps entrouvert à toutes les voluptés…"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ae3423ee-635d-4809-a9c1-96bc06a3ada0",
                                "sense_id": "e204f911-6b82-3582-b25a-bac5b14412d9",
                                "text": "Macron ne fera donc que passer à ce sommet du gotha économique du globe, le temps d’une allocution et de rencontres avec d’autres chefs d’État, avant de rejoindre le Puy-de-Dôme pour adresser ses vœux aux paysans."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "1919a267-737e-37fa-81e8-827d71d9029e",
                        "entry_id": "30eb2d5e-f2a0-31b3-89cd-7a9e0c0fae4a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Élite intellectuelle, scientifique, politique, culturelle..."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "ab708ed5-d74d-4d21-a62f-ec2686c50d01",
                                "sense_id": "1919a267-737e-37fa-81e8-827d71d9029e",
                                "text": "Comment trouver une vraie place dans le gotha scientifique lorsque l’on est dépositaire que de 1% des contributions scientifiques mondiales …"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "38fb3e7f-79a7-3f7a-b350-bb87c3fbef4a",
                        "entry_id": "30eb2d5e-f2a0-31b3-89cd-7a9e0c0fae4a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Personnes plus ou moins en vue, qui courent les lieux et les événements à la mode."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "89a0c667-673f-4505-9372-9843d96ab944",
                                "sense_id": "38fb3e7f-79a7-3f7a-b350-bb87c3fbef4a",
                                "text": "Le voyage culminait rue Saint-Benoît, où le Gotha trépignait devant des gorilles en bras de chemise pour être admis dans la discothèque de Jean-Claude Merle."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "eda3daf1-7e54-361f-bd3f-7518b84d9bb7",
                        "entry_id": "30eb2d5e-f2a0-31b3-89cd-7a9e0c0fae4a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Avion utilisé par les Allemands pendant la Première Guerre mondiale."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "20afc72c-7025-4c60-95ab-e3ca5e29ec2c",
                                "sense_id": "eda3daf1-7e54-361f-bd3f-7518b84d9bb7",
                                "text": "C’était l’époque où il y avait continuellement des raids de gothas, l’air grésillait perpétuellement d’une vibration vigilante et sonore d’aéroplanes français."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "5d2a687a-1137-43e9-8837-3bf68efe5fc2",
                        "source_entry_id": "30eb2d5e-f2a0-31b3-89cd-7a9e0c0fae4a",
                        "source_sense_id": "cba5a4b8-f046-3709-9aee-7d93ca105626",
                        "target_lang_word": "aristocracy",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "aristocracy",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cc03e0c4-20d2-3dcb-a842-303c8435ee13",
                                        "entry_id": "65874389-32a9-3992-afee-59df55003fb6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The nobility, or the hereditary ruling class."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2510ea8e-71f2-4c8b-abed-390abf985c2d",
                                                "sense_id": "cc03e0c4-20d2-3dcb-a842-303c8435ee13",
                                                "text": "But when Nietzsche has the incredible lack of humour and lack of imagination to ask us to believe that his aristocracy is an aristocracy of strong muscles or an aristocracy of strong wills, it is necessary to point out the truth. It is an aristocracy of weak nerves."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1e069279-8935-4742-b667-0d920ef362f6",
                                                "sense_id": "cc03e0c4-20d2-3dcb-a842-303c8435ee13",
                                                "text": "That, then, which is called aristocracy in some countries and nobility in others arose out of the governments founded upon conquest."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f27a1118-fac0-3706-88ea-29ab49659eb3",
                                        "entry_id": "65874389-32a9-3992-afee-59df55003fb6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Government by such a class, or a state with such a government."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "94b4ef6e-8f25-4c1d-8ef6-832cf800ab22",
                                                "sense_id": "f27a1118-fac0-3706-88ea-29ab49659eb3",
                                                "text": "How many false principles have been laid down, how much delusion supported, by reference to the glories of Athens and of Rome! It remained for a later time to observe that those so-called republics were but aristocracy in its most oppressive form; and what are now the people were then positive slaves;..."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2d947404-77ff-3ec0-b9ac-b31901fd9f0d",
                                        "entry_id": "65874389-32a9-3992-afee-59df55003fb6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A class of people considered (not normally universally) superior to others."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "9c51524a-937c-48cf-8d70-9ea97b600c77",
                        "source_entry_id": "30eb2d5e-f2a0-31b3-89cd-7a9e0c0fae4a",
                        "source_sense_id": "e204f911-6b82-3582-b25a-bac5b14412d9",
                        "target_lang_word": "high society",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "high society",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "49eacd12-3e32-3833-9928-40bec74a00a6",
                                        "entry_id": "5a2d6b4b-7eaa-38b6-b1aa-47748988c089",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The socially interacting wealthy fashionable elite of a society, especially in Western societies."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2bcf34b8-6f0d-4312-baba-9e8680bfb7e6",
                                                "sense_id": "49eacd12-3e32-3833-9928-40bec74a00a6",
                                                "text": "“‘What are the gaieties of the Rich, the splendours of the Powerful, what is the pride of the Great, what are the gaudy pleasures of High Society?’”"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "41f58ed4-ee1c-48b8-9d7f-9a20ac5af6c7",
                                                "sense_id": "49eacd12-3e32-3833-9928-40bec74a00a6",
                                                "text": "Exclusive nightclubs are out of style with me / 'Cause I don't associate with high society"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
